# 2014-8: Go The Distance
# Write a function that returns the distance between two points in a space of any number of dimensions.

Distance ← √/+≡ⁿ₂-

⍤⤙≍ 3 Distance 2 5                   # one-dimensional space
⍤⤙≍ 5 Distance [2 2] [5 6]           # two-dimensional space
⍤⤙≍ 0 Distance [] []                 # zero dimension space
⍤⤙≍ 10 Distance [2 2 3 4] [3 7 10 9] # four-dimensions
